abar Hill fall in the price range of ₹ 47,618 - ₹ 91,036 per sqft. While 115 properties are available in ready to move state, 111 properties are available in resale state, 51 properties are available in under construction state. Key projects near Malabar Hill are Lodha Costiera, Lodha Seamont, Lodha Altamount, Carmichael Residences, andImperial Towers. Popular localities near Malabar Hill are Chowpatty, Babulnath, Teen Batti, Nepean Sea Road, Walkeshwar and Kemps Corner Malabar Hill.\n\n[Explore Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\nMumbai Real Estate Market Report | Jan-Mar 2026\n\n[Download](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/research-insights/reports/prop-index-mumbai-q1-2026-april-2026.html)\n\nAverage Rate\n\n₹71172 per sqft\n\n3.3% (for last month)\n\nDemand Supply\n\nHigh Demand\n\nLow Supply\n\nAnnual Yield\n\n3.3 %\n\nMumbai Real Estate Report\n\nMumbai | Jan-Mar 2026\n\nSource: MagicBricks Research\n\n[Download Report](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/research-insights/reports/prop-index-mumbai-q1-2026-april-2026.html)\n\n### Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nRatings & Reviews\n\nA Peaceful Spiritual Oasis Malabar Hill is unique\n\nA Peaceful Spiritual Oasis Malabar Hill is unique because we have the Banganga Tank nearby. The spiritual vibe combined with the absolute silence at night makes our home feel very special.\n\n- Guest User, Owner\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days jogging through the Hanging Gardens. Living in Malabar Hill feels like a hill station because of the lush trees and quiet streets.\n\n- Guest User, Owner\n\n[View all Reviews](https://www.magicbricks.com/flats-in-malabar-hill-mumbai-for-sale-pppfs)\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days\n\nMorning Walks Amidst Greenery I start my days jogging through the Hanging Gardens. Living in Malabar Hill feels like a hill station because of the lush trees and quiet streets.\n\n- Guest User, Owner\n\nSerene Views and Fresh Air Living here provides\n\nSerene Views and Fresh Air Living here provides a much-needed sanctuary from Mumbai's frantic pace. Our apartment overlooks the Queen's Necklace, and the sea breeze keeps the air remarkably fresh. Safety is never a concern for us given the high-profile security. Malabar Hill truly remains the most peaceful and prestigious address for my family's lifestyle.\n\n- Guest User, Owner\n\n4.4/5\n\nMalabar Hill Rating Based on 57 Reviews\n\nEnvironment\n\n4.6\n\nEnvironment 4.4/5\n\nNeighbourhood 4.6\n\nRoads 4.5\n\nSafety 4.7\n\nCleanliness 4.6\n\nCommuting\n\n4.4\n\nCommuting 4.4/5\n\nPublic Transport 4.6\n\nParking 4.3\n\nConnectivity 4.5\n\nTraffic 4.3\n\nPlaces of Interest\n\n4.2\n\nPlaces of Interest 4.4/5\n\nSchools 4.4\n\nHospitals 4.1\n\nRestaurants 3.9\n\nMarkets 4.5\n\n## Flats Price Trend in Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nAverage Flat Price in Malabar Hill\n\n₹80936/ sq.ft 17% QoQ*\n\nNearby Locality (Avg. Price / sq.ft)\n\nNS Patkar Marg\n\n₹78199/ sq.ft 15% QoQ*\n\nChembur\n\n₹24654/ sq.ft 2% QoQ*\n\nCumballa Hill\n\n -- *\n\nPrice Trends\n\n1Y 3Y 5Y\n\nTable View\n\nQuarter Malabar Hill\n\n(% Change in Q-o-Q)NS Patkar Marg\n\n(% Change in Q-o-Q)Chembur\n\n(% Change in Q-o-Q)Cumballa Hill\n\n(% Change in Q-o-Q)\nApr-June'26₹ 80936/ sq.ft 17%₹ 78199/ sq.ft 15%₹ 24654/ sq.ft 2%--\nJan-Mar'26₹ 69326/ sq.ft-6%₹ 68091/ sq.ft-7%₹ 24165/ sq.ft 1%--\nOct-Dec'25₹ 73525/ sq.ft 5%--₹ 23976/ sq.ft 1%₹ 71630/ sq.ft-1%\nJul-Sept'25₹ 69866/ sq.ft-4%--₹ 23734/ sq.ft-1%₹ 72284/ sq.ft 1%\n\nYear Malabar Hill\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)NS Patkar Marg\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)Chembur\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)Cumballa Hill\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)\n2025₹ 69489/ sq.ft 9%₹ 69876/ sq.ft 13%₹ 23448/ sq.ft 7%₹ 65226/ sq.ft 16%\n2024₹ 63991/ sq.ft 9%₹ 61576/ sq.ft 6%₹ 21827/ sq.ft 8%₹ 56163/ sq.ft 1%\n2023₹ 58641/ sq.ft 5%--₹ 20203/ sq.ft 4%₹ 55685/ sq.ft 2%\n\nYear Malabar Hill\n\n(% Change in Y-o-Y)NS Patkar Marg\n\n(% Change in Y-o